---
layout: "base.webc"
title: "2015 January"
id: "201501"
poemTitle: "A Moment in Time"
author: "Eila Webster"
endOfYear: false
---

<div class="full-width">
  <poem-grid
    class="no-middle-images"
    :title="poemTitle"
    :author="author"
    :theme="bgTheme"
  >
    <!-- Header Section -->

    <!-- Column 1 Images (15%) -->
    <div slot="col-1-images">
      <poem-img
        src="/poems/january-poem-a-moment-in-time/image-1.avif"
        alt=""
      ></poem-img>
      ><poem-img
        src="/poems/january-poem-a-moment-in-time/image-2.avif"
        alt=""
      ></poem-img>
    </div>

    <!-- Column 2 Text -->
    <div slot="col-2-text">
      <p>
        Grasp the moment – Savour it, <br />
        Don’t ever let it pass by; <br />
        We cannot turn back the clock<br />
        no matter how we try. <br />
      </p>

      <p>
        The past’s behind, the future’s veiled, <br />
        the present’s ours alone; <br />
        Don’t sigh (if only) with regret,<br />
        for all those hours now flown. <br />
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Column 3 Middle Images -->
    <div slot="col-3-images"></div>

    <!-- Column 4 Text -->
    <div slot="col-4-text">
      <p>
        Let us use our time wisely, <br />
        this priceless gift from Heaven <br />
        Treasure the hours and never waste <br />
        the new day we are given.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Column 5 Images (15%) -->
    <div slot="col-5-images">
      <poem-img
        src="/poems/january-poem-a-moment-in-time/image-3.avif"
        alt=""
      ></poem-img>
      ><poem-img
        src="/poems/january-poem-a-moment-in-time/image-0.avif"
        alt=""
      ></poem-img>
    </div>
  </poem-grid>
</div>
